ASTRAL VIBRATION MODEL
FUNDAMENTALS
Emotion states map directly to vibration rates.
Astral entities are more rigidly locked to one frequency band than humans.
Humans can move between bands; most non-human entities cannot.
Low-frequency entities (demons) only process fear / hate / shame.

KEY VARIABLES
Frequency scale : 0+  to  900+
Dimension layers : 1st  to  9th
Constraint level : high for entities, low for humans

ENTITY TYPES BY BAND
9th          God / Source
8th          Archangels, Seraphim, Cherubim
7th          Dominions, Virtues, Powers, Ascended Masters
6th          Watchers, Guardian Angels, Higher Souls
5th          Enlightened humans, some fallen angels
4th–3rd      Ordinary humans, intelligent animals
2nd          Demons, Nephelim, insects, plants (fear, panic, rage)
1st          Sub-sentient life, microbes, base instinct only

