900+   Enlightenment, oneness, bliss
800+   Unconditional love, compassion
700+   Peace, gratitude, jubilation
600+   Fulfillment, contentment, inner peace
500+   Joy, creativity, meraki
400+   Hope, courage, pride, optimism
300+   Desire, lust, impatience, regret
200+   Sadness, guilt, shame, grief
100+   Fear, anxiety, hate, agony
  0+   Hopelessness, despair, isolation

CORE CLAIM
Demons and similar low-band entities stay fixed in 0–200 range.
They cannot parse higher-frequency states.
Humans can raise or drop their own vibration and therefore interact across more layers.
